  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.2.0:\n\nBreaking changes:\n- TryGetFirstValue moved from List<T> in Tellurian.Utilities to IEnumerable<T> in Tellurian.Utilities.Linq\n\nNew features:\n- NumberExtensions: int.IsAlsoOddOrEven(int) for parity checking\n- LinqExtensions: IndexOf(Func<T, bool>) to find index of first matching element\n- DateAndTimeExtensions: TimeSpan.Max(TimeSpan) and TimeSpan.Min(TimeSpan)\n- StringExtensions: AsArray(), FirstItem(string)\n- ObjectExtensions: AsArray(), AsEnumerable()\n- ColorExtensions: IsNotWhiteColor, expanded named color support to 70+ colors\n- MarkupStringExtensions: Span(string) and Div(string) HTML helpers",
